1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:04,920
(Mrs Petrescu:)15 minutes can save you
15% or more on car insurance.

2
00:00:08,755 --> 00:00:11,005
(Stuart:)Anybody else coming
to this thing? Uh...

3
00:00:20,116 --> 00:00:21,746
- What's your name? Okay.
- Jeff.

4
00:00:21,773 --> 00:00:22,673
(Penny:)Okay.

5
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,840
My favorite part
is your shower scene.

6
00:00:24,839 --> 00:00:27,709
(Penny:)Been hearing that a lot today.

7
00:00:27,709 --> 00:00:29,679
(Jeff:)I even have a screen grab
on my phone.

8
00:00:29,677 --> 00:00:32,597
(Penny:)Yep, there they are.

9
00:00:32,597 --> 00:00:35,047
(Leonard:)Okay, let's
keep it moving.

10
00:00:35,049 --> 00:00:37,719
(Penny:)Here you go.

11
00:00:37,719 --> 00:00:39,219
(Leonard:)Should've punched that guy.

12
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,140
(Penny:)Well, go ahead.
He's right over there.

13
00:00:41,139 --> 00:00:44,109
(Leonard:)Why do you do that?
Can't you let me have my moment?

14
00:00:45,526 --> 00:00:47,196
- Hello.
- Hi.

15
00:00:47,195 --> 00:00:48,445
(Awkward guy:)I like your movies.

16
00:00:48,446 --> 00:00:49,126
Thank you!

17
00:00:49,154 --> 00:00:50,394
(Awkward guy:)I saw both of them.

18
00:00:50,398 --> 00:00:52,068
(Penny:)I assume we're still
talking about the movies,

19
00:00:52,066 --> 00:00:54,736
(Penny:)but after today,
who knows.

20
00:00:54,736 --> 00:00:57,156
(Awkward guy:)You think I could get
a picture of us?

21
00:00:57,155 --> 00:00:57,955
(Penny:)Oh, sure.

22
00:00:57,956 --> 00:00:59,036
(Awkward guy:)And, uh, could you be

23
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:00,070
(Awkward guy:)giving me a kiss?

